Z||000000||gtsonly||07-13-2000||02:03 AM||||i just put on a holley look-alike side air scoop from fiero conversions in canada. 24.95 and hand laid fiberglass. wicked nice!! anyways back to my question, i started my gt up yesterday for the first time in weeks and i nhear this noise coming from the intake. sounded like a jet engine sucking air in. it did it for about 3 minutes until warm and went away. first time i have ever heard it. anyone got any ideas of what it could be???? maybe a restriction somewhere up to the TB?? air cleaner??<BR>  chris hatch||||reg||1
